    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "It all started in a cold winter* during the 2015 Christmas holidays. It was a casual chat between our founder and a non-tech-savvy business owner in the USA. He had more software than his business needs, but he was still not happy with those and not achieving his needs.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/c80cab5f2d860f83.png",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 128,
     "h": 128
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "It sparked the idea. People have software; they need enablers to integrate that software work for them. These trillion-dollar integration issues are not just for extra-large companies but are universal to all sizes.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/00778ed7789ad2fb.png",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1024,
     "h": 1024
    },
    {
