    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "In early 2016, driven by a strong entrepreneurial spirit and a vision to innovate, our founder Dr. Michaeswaran Subramanian embarked on a journey to establish Jivrus Technologies. With unwavering faith and determination, the groundwork was laid in April 2016, culminating in the official registration of Jivrus Technologies as a self-funded startup in India by May 2016.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/7f49cd2470bcece1.png",
     "alt": "Cloud Flow Director",
     "w": 128,
     "h": 128
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "\"In January 2016, after years of cultivating an entrepreneurial mindset, I felt a profound calling to embark on my venture that solves modern software integration issues. I submitted my resignation on February 3, 2016, and concluded my lucrative corporate journey on April 8, 2016—dates that mark the beginning of an exciting new chapter. This pivotal moment led to the creation of Jivrus Technologies, where we are dedicated to delivering intelligent integration, hyper-automation, and codeless computing solutions. Our mission is to empower businesses to seamlessly integrate systems and automate workflows, enabling them to build the automation solutions they envision.\" - Michaes",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/790b1d69262fcd7d.png",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 300,
     "h": 300
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Since our inception, we have been committed to providing innovative solutions in intelligent integration, hyper-automation, and codeless computing, enabling businesses to streamline processes and achieve effortless system automation. Our journey reflects our commitment to innovation, resilience, and the pursuit of excellence in the technology landscape.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
